			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 735020101,
					"content": "「与白昼交班的白昼，从桥上能看见灯塔匆匆下班的背影。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						735020102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "调查"
				},
				{
					"id": 735020102,
					"content": "这，这是什么啊…是谜语吗？还是什么谚语之类的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						735020103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 735020103,
					"content": "与白昼交班的白昼？下，下班的背影…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						735020104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 735020104,
					"content": "这不是旅行者吗？你们也对德鲁苏先生的谜语感兴趣吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						735020105,
						735020106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡玛尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 735020105,
					"content": "这真是谜语吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						735020107
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 735020107,
					"content": "设置这段谜语的人是教令院的一位学者，德鲁苏先生。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						735020108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡玛尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 735020108,
					"content": "据我所知…那位先生在教令院里也算是一个怪人…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						735020109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡玛尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 735020109,
					"content": "他最喜欢的就是和人讨论各种各样的谜语，还有研究各种加密方式。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						735020110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡玛尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 735020110,
					"content": "但他的谜语有的实在是太晦涩难懂了，所以也没多少人愿意和他交流。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						735020111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡玛尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 735020111,
					"content": "所以，他就想出了这种「有奖解谜」的方式。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						735020112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡玛尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 735020112,
					"content": "简单来说，这段谜语实际上是在暗示着一个「藏宝地点」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						735020113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡玛尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 735020113,
					"content": "只要在正确的时间，用正确的方式，到达正确的地点，就能够获得宝藏。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						735020114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡玛尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 735020114,
					"content": "德鲁苏先生也给了提示，说是这些「藏宝地点」都在须弥城内。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						735020115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡玛尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 735020115,
					"content": "但是如你们所见，目前依然还没有一个冒险家能够解开这道谜语。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						735020116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡玛尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 735020116,
					"content": "如果你们有兴趣的话，也可以试试看。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						735020117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡玛尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 735020117,
					"content": "但我从个人角度来说，我其实更建议你们去做点正事啦…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "卡玛尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 735020106,
					"content": "你知道是谁设置的？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						735020107
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7350203,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7350203
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7350203",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 7350203,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
